title: Inter-Party Relations
subtitle: Build one political relationship without pretending that cooperation is free.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
frequency: 200
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_inter_party_relations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_inter_party_relations_timer = 6
card-image: img/poland/cards/coalition-council.webp

= Inter-party relations

Lewica cannot govern alone. It can invest in one relationship this month, but
every durable channel tells other parties—and Lewica's own currents—something
about the coalition it may prefer later.

- @ko
- @third_way
- @pis_solidarists
- @konf
- @stand_alone

@ko
title: Strengthen the working relationship with KO
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. KO relation +8; socialist dissent rises.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A permanent parliamentary liaison requires one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; poland_inter_party_focus = "KO"; ko_relation += 8; p2050_relation += 1; constitutional_restraint += 2; judicial_legitimacy += 2; razem_dissent += 4; labor_dissent += 2; party_unity -= 1; news_headline = "Lewica and KO strengthen their permanent parliamentary channel"

Procedure, courts and European policy provide quick common ground. Economic
policy remains harder, while the socialist wing warns that coordination with
the largest liberal party easily becomes dependence.

- #poland_card_finish


@third_way
title: Build a rural and state-capacity channel with PSL and Polska 2050
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. PSL and Polska 2050 relations +7; rights-oriented caucuses object.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Rural, local-government and parliamentary liaison requires one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; poland_inter_party_focus = "PSL and Polska 2050"; psl_relation += 7; p2050_relation += 7; local_network += 2; public_trust += 1; progressives_dissent += 4; spring_dissent += 2; news_headline = "Lewica opens a permanent rural and state-capacity channel to PSL and Polska 2050"

The talks begin with clinics, transport, local finance and administrative
capacity. Rights policy is not abandoned; it is also not permitted to lead the
meeting.

- #poland_card_finish


@pis_solidarists
title: Open a working channel to PiS's social-solidarist current
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Bargaining capital +6, PiS relation +8 and hostility −10; the liberal opposition and PiS right object.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A serious social-policy channel requires one resource.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.poland_inter_party_focus = "PiS social solidarists";
Q.negotiation_capital += 6;
Q.pis_relation += 8;
if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
    Q.government_negotiation_hostility -= 10;
}
Q.pis_negotiation_hostility_relief += 10;
Q.pis_solidarist_share += 5;
Q.pis_market_hardliner_share -= 5;
Q.pis_accept_social += 5;
Q.ko_relation -= 4;
Q.p2050_relation -= 3;
Q.psl_relation -= 2;
Q.government_coalition_dissent += 4;
Q.united_right_cohesion -= 4;
Q.progressives_dissent += 3;
Q.razem_dissent += 2;
for (const id of ["solidarna", "pis_security", "pis_culture"]) {
    const current = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
        return record.id == id;
    });
    if (current) {
        current.cohesion -= 3;
        current.grievance_memory += 8;
    }
}
const welfare = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
    return record.id == "pis_welfare";
});
if (welfare) {
    welfare.relation += 8;
    welfare.cohesion += 2;
}
Q.news_headline =
    "Lewica reconciles with PiS solidarists and divides both larger camps";
!}

Pensions, wages, public services and state investment provide a real basis for
conversation. KO, Poland 2050 and PSL see an attack on the capitalist centre.
The PiS market, security and culture-war currents see the social wing acquire
an outside partner and record their dissent.

- #poland_card_finish


@konf
title: Open a narrow anti-privatisation channel to Konfederacja deputies
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Konfederacja relation +6; democratic and progressive relationships suffer.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Vetting a narrow parliamentary channel requires one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; poland_inter_party_focus = "a narrow Konfederacja channel"; konf_relation += 6; ko_relation -= 3; p2050_relation -= 2; pis_relation -= 1; progressive_credibility -= 3; progressives_dissent += 7; razem_dissent += 4; far_right_agenda += 2; news_headline = "A narrow anti-privatisation vote opens an argument across Lewica"

One vote on public ownership does not erase the radical right's programme.
Many inside Lewica regard even a bounded channel as normalisation.

- #poland_card_finish


@stand_alone
title: Lewica can stand alone for now
subtitle: Spend nothing and preserve autonomy; no relationship improves.
on-arrival: poland_inter_party_focus = "party autonomy"; party_unity += 1; media_capacity += 1; news_headline = "Lewica invests in its own line instead of another party relationship"

Whether because it cannot or will not, the party builds no external tie this
month.

- #poland_card_finish
